## Migration DO / DON'T
- DO keep each migration reversible where practical.
- DO review a migration's blast radius before it touches a table with production data.
- DON'T edit a migration that already shipped — write a new one.
- DON'T seed with production data, even scrubbed-looking — sanitize from a fixture, not a dump.
